# SCR-12 · Back after being away, the digest, and how you are told in another window.
start
see any key: close
key Escape
type :away 1m
key Enter
see back after
type :away off
key Enter
see what happened never shows by itself
type :digest
key Enter
see nothing new since you last left
type :notify bell
key Enter
see the bell rings when something waits
type :notify text
key Enter
see a desktop note when something waits
type :notify off
key Enter
see no word in another window
